<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African money mkt shortage at 5.912 bln rand Wed.</title>
<headline>S.African money mkt shortage at 5.912 bln rand Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said the money market shortage fell to 5.912 billion rand on Wednesday from 6.587 billion rand on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
